# Directories under /data that the repository owns completely. On every boot,
# storm-entrypoint deletes files there that server/owned/ does not ship. One
# path per line, relative to /data and below plugins/ (for example
# plugins/TheStorm/content/quests).
#
# Never list a directory a plugin writes runtime data into: plugins/TheStorm
# holds the-storm.db, so it is not a root. Its YAML files are still overwritten
# from server/owned/ on every boot by itzg's /plugins sync.
